{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0321","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000000ff:text","row":41251,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"そして、俺は目覚めた。","en":"And then I awoke.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905917","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00001","en":"And then I was awake.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese describes the event of waking, not the resulting state of being awake.","remedy":"I woke up.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":21,"start":9,"text":"I was awake."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:0000012d:text","row":41252,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"念のため、茂みの奥を確認する。","en":"Just to be safe, I check deeper in the bushes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905918","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00002","en":"Just to be sure, I recheck the depths of the thicket.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000163:text","row":41253,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"よし。","en":"All right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905919","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00003","en":"Good.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000181:text","row":41254,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"位相のずれ。とでも言うのか。","en":"A phase shift. Is that what I should call it?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905920","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00004","en":"Phase shift. Should I call it that?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000001b5:text","row":41255,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"俺の目だけが観測できるそれは、向こう側への帰還の道のり。","en":"That thing only my eyes can observe is the path back to the far side.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905921","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00005","en":"That's the path that returns to the opposite side, that only my eyes are capable of observing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000205:text","row":41256,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"観測する者だけに、真実となる。","en":"Only to the observer does it become truth.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905922","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00006","en":"Only for the observer it becomes real.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:0000023b:text","row":41257,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"そこをくぐれば、帰れる。","en":"Pass through there, and I can go back.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905923","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00007","en":"It's possible to go home through there,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:0000026b:text","row":41258,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"人の満ちた世界に。","en":"To a world full of people.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905924","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00008","en":"back to that world full of people.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000295:text","row":41259,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"けれど。そう。","en":"But. That's right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905925","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00009","en":"However. Yes,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000002bb:text","row":41260,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は―――","en":"I—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905926","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00010","en":"I will---","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000003ba:text","row":41261,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんの姿はない。","en":"There was no sign of Yoko.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905927","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00011","en":"Youko-chan is nowhere to be seen,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000003e8:text","row":41262,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"ただ弁当だけが机に置いてあった。","en":"Only a boxed lunch had been left on the desk.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905928","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00012","en":"just the lunch alone is set on the table.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000420:text","row":41263,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"学校に向かう。","en":"I head for school.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905929","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00013","en":"I head towards school.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:0000053b:text","row":41264,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"無人の世界を歩く。","en":"I walk through a world without people.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905930","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00014","en":"I walk in this uninhabited world.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000565:text","row":41265,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"人だけでなく、生物そのものの気配がない。","en":"Not just people. There is no trace of living things at all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905931","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00015","en":"There is no trace not just of people, but of any and all living things.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000005a5:text","row":41266,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"満ちている感じがしない。","en":"The world doesn't feel full.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905932","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00016","en":"There is no sense of it being full.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000005d5:text","row":41267,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"蝉も鳴かない。","en":"Not even the cicadas are singing.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905933","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00017","en":"The cicadas are not crying.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000005fb:text","row":41268,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"不自然な、空間。","en":"An unnatural space.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905934","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00018","en":"The atmosphere is unnatural.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese calls the space itself unnatural. 'Atmosphere' shifts this to an intangible mood or surrounding air.","remedy":"An unnatural space.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":0,"text":"The atmosphere is unnatural."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000623:text","row":41269,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"交差した世界の中核で、渦巻く矛盾。","en":"A contradiction swirling at the heart of intersecting worlds.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905935","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00019","en":"A contradiction that swirls into the eddy at the very core of this Crossed World.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:0000065d:text","row":41270,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"わずか八人の小世界。","en":"A tiny world of just eight people.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905936","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00020","en":"A tiny world of just eight people.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000691:text","row":41271,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905937","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00021","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000006b1:text","row":41272,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"七香も、出てこない。","en":"Nanaka doesn't appear either.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905938","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00022","en":"Nanaka does not show herself either.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:000006e5:text","row":41273,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“……………………”","speakerJa":"七香","speakerEn":"Nanaka","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905939","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0101:00023","en":"Nanaka: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000748:text","row":41274,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"どうするか？","en":"What should I do?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000794:choice:01","row":41275,"ordinal":25,"kind":"choice","jp":"学校に行く","en":"Go to school","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0321:00000794:choice:02","row":41276,"ordinal":26,"kind":"choice","jp":"田崎食料に行く","en":"Go to Tazaki Foods","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
